1
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
=Godslayer=
(Adapted from the novel Godslayer.)

2
00:00:33,041 --> 00:00:35,708
(Divine Era, Lunisolar Calendar,
Waxing Moon)

3
00:00:35,708 --> 00:00:36,833
(Ascension Victors are)

4
00:00:37,250 --> 00:00:38,125
(Lu Yuanqing,)

5
00:00:38,125 --> 00:00:39,250
(Ascension Office of Middle City)
(Yan Jiu,)

6
00:00:39,250 --> 00:00:40,166
(Ascension Office of Middle City)
(and Duo Mu.)

7
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:41,583
(Their names are entered
in the register.)

8
00:00:41,583 --> 00:00:42,958
(The Ascension Gate shall open.)

9
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,750
(Tokens granted for ascension.)

10
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:46,000
(Entry to the Middle City is granted.)

11
00:00:46,125 --> 00:00:47,625
Lu Yuanqing.

12
00:00:47,791 --> 00:00:49,291
You have to go alone.

13
00:00:49,541 --> 00:00:50,625
Those are the rules.

14
00:00:51,541 --> 00:00:52,375
Be careful.

15
00:00:53,666 --> 00:00:54,500
I will.

16
00:00:59,042 --> 00:01:01,542
(Worse than the wicked,
better than the good.)

17
00:02:19,125 --> 00:02:20,333
(Ascension Temple)

18
00:02:21,125 --> 00:02:23,542
(Lu Yuanqing)

19
00:02:28,083 --> 00:02:30,250
(Lu Yuanqing)

20
00:02:39,916 --> 00:02:41,375
That Eye of Heaven Formation outside

21
00:02:41,916 --> 00:02:44,083
(Lu Yuanqing)
took quite some effort to set up.

22
00:02:44,416 --> 00:02:46,083
Yet it didn't leave a scratch on you.

23
00:02:46,500 --> 00:02:47,791
Making it this far...

24
00:02:48,250 --> 00:02:49,750
you've clearly got some skill.

25
00:02:50,791 --> 00:02:51,958
Who are you?

26
00:02:53,791 --> 00:02:54,875
Dazedi.

27
00:02:54,875 --> 00:02:56,083
Xianliang Village.

28
00:02:56,500 --> 00:02:57,208
(Lu Yuanqing)
Your surname is Lu.

29
00:02:57,208 --> 00:02:58,208
(Lu Yuanqing)
And name is Yuanqing.

30
00:03:01,583 --> 00:03:02,625
Though the road is long,

31
00:03:02,625 --> 00:03:04,083
walk on, and you will arrive.

32
00:03:04,416 --> 00:03:05,833
Keep a clear heart along the way.

33
00:03:06,833 --> 00:03:08,041
That's what your name means.
A good name.

34
00:03:08,708 --> 00:03:10,041
You killed Qi Hao

35
00:03:10,541 --> 00:03:11,583
and burned the boats.

36
00:03:11,833 --> 00:03:14,000
Now you plan to move on to the Middle
City like nothing happened.

37
00:03:14,375 --> 00:03:15,750
Have you ever wondered

38
00:03:17,083 --> 00:03:20,083
who the Qi family will make pay for it?

39
00:03:21,541 --> 00:03:23,083
Eighteen businesses on the Row,

40
00:03:23,083 --> 00:03:24,458
thirty-four indenture contracts.

41
00:03:24,791 --> 00:03:28,125
The Qi family holds all
those girls' lives in their hands.

42
00:03:29,166 --> 00:03:31,041
You think killing Meiniang

43
00:03:31,291 --> 00:03:32,291
put an end to it?

44
00:03:33,666 --> 00:03:35,083
As long as the Qi family remains,

45
00:03:35,416 --> 00:03:37,166
there will always be another Meiniang.

46
00:03:39,083 --> 00:03:41,125
The Qi family has issued
a funeral notice.

47
00:03:41,791 --> 00:03:43,708
They've invited you
to pay your respects.

48
00:03:44,750 --> 00:03:46,375
Why are you telling me this?

49
00:03:47,125 --> 00:03:47,916
Because

50
00:03:49,750 --> 00:03:50,958
you're a hero.

51
00:03:51,167 --> 00:03:51,917
(Lu Yuanqing)

52
00:03:54,333 --> 00:03:57,125
(Lu Yuanqing)

53
00:03:58,500 --> 00:03:59,291
And heroes

54
00:03:59,291 --> 00:04:01,750
should do what heroes are meant to do.

55
00:04:07,375 --> 00:04:08,166
Wait.

56
00:04:09,375 --> 00:04:10,875
I'll remember that strike.

57
00:04:11,208 --> 00:04:12,625
Next time we meet,

58
00:04:14,708 --> 00:04:15,791
you'd better watch yourself.

59
00:04:27,541 --> 00:04:28,083
What's going on?

60
00:04:28,500 --> 00:04:30,333
Come on. We're going back
to the Lower City.

61
00:04:31,625 --> 00:04:32,750
The Lower City?

62
00:04:33,833 --> 00:04:34,791
What about the Ascension Trials?

63
00:04:34,958 --> 00:04:36,708
We save people first.

64
00:04:44,250 --> 00:04:45,625
(Spirit Tablet of the Late
Young Master Qi Hao)

65
00:04:46,541 --> 00:04:47,333
Sect Master.

66
00:04:47,333 --> 00:04:48,791
Your guest has arrived.

67
00:04:50,708 --> 00:04:51,791
Wait.

68
00:04:53,125 --> 00:04:54,833
You actually dared to come.

69
00:04:55,500 --> 00:04:57,125
Aren't you afraid I'll kill you?

70
00:05:00,125 --> 00:05:01,375
Under the Ascension Code,

71
00:05:02,500 --> 00:05:04,000
during the Ascension Trials,

72
00:05:04,666 --> 00:05:06,541
if a sect harms a Challenger,

73
00:05:07,666 --> 00:05:09,000
the entire sect will be struck
from the rolls.

74
00:05:12,125 --> 00:05:13,291
Would you dare?

75
00:05:16,291 --> 00:05:17,666
Under the Ascension Code,

76
00:05:18,500 --> 00:05:20,875
any Challenger who attempts
to kill a sect leader

77
00:05:20,916 --> 00:05:22,125
will be disqualified.

78
00:05:23,125 --> 00:05:24,958
So you can't touch me either.

79
00:05:27,166 --> 00:05:30,166
But the girls from Flower Boat Row
are different.

80
00:05:30,458 --> 00:05:32,708
I hold their indenture contracts.

81
00:06:00,791 --> 00:06:01,875
Now,

82
00:06:01,958 --> 00:06:04,166
I'll give you a chance to play the hero.

83
00:06:05,708 --> 00:06:08,791
These two Qiongqi haven't eaten
in three days.

84
00:06:09,958 --> 00:06:11,625
Of the two groups of girls,

85
00:06:12,416 --> 00:06:14,208
you can save only one.

86
00:06:20,666 --> 00:06:24,291
I know what carried you

87
00:06:24,291 --> 00:06:25,791
all the way here from Dazedi.

88
00:06:25,791 --> 00:06:29,000
That self-indulgent dream
of being a hero.

89
00:06:32,750 --> 00:06:34,958
There are no heroes in this world.

90
00:06:35,583 --> 00:06:37,458
Only the strong devouring the weak.

91
00:06:37,958 --> 00:06:39,833
If you want to change your fate,

92
00:06:40,333 --> 00:06:42,416
you'll have to climb over
other people's lives

93
00:06:42,958 --> 00:06:44,083
to get there.

94
00:06:55,375 --> 00:06:56,541
(God and monster faces.)

95
00:06:56,541 --> 00:06:57,916
(The toss decides
who chooses the arena.)

96
00:06:58,291 --> 00:06:59,833
(Of the two groups of girls,)

97
00:07:00,291 --> 00:07:02,083
(you can save only one.)

98
00:07:02,750 --> 00:07:04,708
(Lu Yuanqing)
(Whatever Mr. Qi says is the rule.)

99
00:07:04,708 --> 00:07:07,083
(I'll give you a chance
to play the hero.)

100
00:07:07,833 --> 00:07:09,375
(If you want to change your fate,)

101
00:07:09,791 --> 00:07:11,750
(you'll have to climb
over other people's lives)

102
00:07:11,916 --> 00:07:13,833
(to get there.)

103
00:07:18,125 --> 00:07:19,291
(The Linglong Beads.)

104
00:07:19,291 --> 00:07:20,750
(The Ling Bead becomes a mace,)

105
00:07:20,916 --> 00:07:22,041
(and the Long Bead becomes armor.)

106
00:07:22,458 --> 00:07:23,333
(He's trying to cheat!)

107
00:07:23,333 --> 00:07:25,083
(Gods are monsters.)

108
00:07:25,375 --> 00:07:28,416
(And monsters are gods.)

109
00:09:01,750 --> 00:09:04,416
So this is the young hero
everyone's been praising.

110
00:09:06,833 --> 00:09:08,625
These two Qiongqi

111
00:09:08,916 --> 00:09:10,791
are private property of the Qi family.

112
00:09:11,166 --> 00:09:12,500
You killed them.

113
00:09:12,833 --> 00:09:13,625
By the Code,

114
00:09:14,041 --> 00:09:16,291
I have the right to execute you myself.

115
00:09:17,420 --> 00:09:18,520
Hahahaha!

116
00:09:19,416 --> 00:09:20,291
Lu Yuanqing,

117
00:09:20,833 --> 00:09:21,916
you can't

118
00:09:22,166 --> 00:09:24,083
save everyone in this world.

119
00:09:24,220 --> 00:09:25,440
Hahahaha!

120
00:09:26,666 --> 00:09:27,833
Aren't you curious

121
00:09:28,291 --> 00:09:30,083
why I came here alone?

122
00:09:31,375 --> 00:09:33,166
The Capital is
under Heaven's protection.

123
00:09:33,375 --> 00:09:34,708
Monsters aren't supposed
to be allowed inside.

124
00:09:35,291 --> 00:09:37,458
But the Qi family keeps monsters

125
00:09:37,666 --> 00:09:38,708
for blood sport,

126
00:09:38,750 --> 00:09:40,208
so you built a secret passage

127
00:09:40,208 --> 00:09:41,416
to smuggle them in.

128
00:09:41,666 --> 00:09:44,333
It runs from the back mountain
straight to this tunnel.

129
00:09:44,583 --> 00:09:45,208
Right?

130
00:10:03,875 --> 00:10:06,041
(Bro, your troops are in position.)

131
00:10:06,541 --> 00:10:07,791
(In position.)

132
00:10:07,791 --> 00:10:09,166
(At your command.)

133
00:10:12,500 --> 00:10:14,000
A pack of Haogui?

134
00:10:14,583 --> 00:10:17,666
You think they can stand against
a century of Qi heavenly thunder?

135
00:10:31,666 --> 00:10:32,458
Wait.

136
00:10:33,083 --> 00:10:34,666
If you want my help,

137
00:10:34,916 --> 00:10:36,083
you'll have to help me too.

138
00:10:42,875 --> 00:10:43,666
How?

139
00:10:44,666 --> 00:10:45,958
Help me turn the tables.

140
00:10:48,416 --> 00:10:49,750
Overturn the Qi family's

141
00:10:50,375 --> 00:10:52,708
century-old Thunder field.

142
00:10:56,625 --> 00:10:57,583
That's

143
00:10:58,166 --> 00:10:59,333
not exactly honorable.

144
00:11:00,333 --> 00:11:01,583
What good is honor

145
00:11:02,875 --> 00:11:04,125
if it can't beat the wicked?

146
00:11:08,125 --> 00:11:09,625
Looks like the Qi family

147
00:11:10,541 --> 00:11:12,166
picked the wrong fight this time.

148
00:11:20,291 --> 00:11:21,166
Seal!

149
00:11:26,583 --> 00:11:27,458
You...

150
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:29,833
You said good can't beat evil.

151
00:11:30,125 --> 00:11:30,875
I agree.

152
00:11:31,875 --> 00:11:32,875
So,

153
00:11:33,083 --> 00:11:34,166
if you want to defeat evil,

154
00:11:34,666 --> 00:11:36,291
you have to be worse than the wicked.

155
00:11:37,250 --> 00:11:38,708
What are you going to do?

156
00:11:38,875 --> 00:11:40,250
I'm going to

157
00:11:40,250 --> 00:11:42,333
turn the Qi Sect

158
00:11:42,333 --> 00:11:43,958
into a half-monster clan.

159
00:11:45,083 --> 00:11:46,583
Every last one of them

160
00:11:46,958 --> 00:11:48,416
will be tainted by monster aura.

161
00:11:48,750 --> 00:11:49,916
Not one will be spared.

162
00:12:33,958 --> 00:12:36,125
Die!

163
00:12:44,083 --> 00:12:45,416
Come on! Kill me!

164
00:12:45,416 --> 00:12:47,541
Come on! Do it!

165
00:12:47,541 --> 00:12:49,916
Death would be too easy for you.

166
00:12:50,125 --> 00:12:51,791
You can become a half-monster too.

167
00:12:53,833 --> 00:12:57,875
(After tonight, there will be
no Qi Clan left in the Capital.)

168
00:13:01,250 --> 00:13:01,791
Go.

169
00:13:02,333 --> 00:13:04,000
No one will trouble you again.

170
00:13:10,708 --> 00:13:11,541
Go.

171
00:13:11,708 --> 00:13:12,750
Thank you, hero.

172
00:13:19,541 --> 00:13:20,416
Duo Mu,

173
00:13:20,416 --> 00:13:22,750
what do you think makes someone a hero?

174
00:13:24,125 --> 00:13:26,125
Someone who's strong,

175
00:13:26,416 --> 00:13:28,083
beats the bad guys,
and saves the good guys.

176
00:13:30,041 --> 00:13:30,791
A hero

177
00:13:31,166 --> 00:13:32,666
has to be worse than the wicked,

178
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:34,458
better than the good.

179
00:13:34,958 --> 00:13:37,166
Worse enough to keep evil in check,

180
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:38,500
and better enough

181
00:13:38,958 --> 00:13:40,083
to protect what's good.

182
00:13:43,125 --> 00:13:44,625
That's too complicated for me.

183
00:13:45,125 --> 00:13:46,250
I'll just stick with you.

184
00:13:46,250 --> 00:13:48,208
Whatever you say, I do.

185
00:13:55,833 --> 00:13:57,083
Heavenly Law Bureau.

186
00:13:57,083 --> 00:13:57,958
Wang Yan.

187
00:13:57,958 --> 00:13:58,958
Pay respects to the gods.

188
00:14:00,291 --> 00:14:01,166
(Granted.)

189
00:14:05,208 --> 00:14:09,833
(Palace of Yuyou Village)

190
00:14:13,500 --> 00:14:14,375
Your humble servant, Wang Yan,

191
00:14:14,541 --> 00:14:15,625
activated the Heavenly Thunder Device
without permission.

192
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:17,000
I beg the gods to punish me.

193
00:14:17,792 --> 00:14:20,125
(Du, Heaven Guardian God)

194
00:14:20,125 --> 00:14:22,416
Enough. Drop the act.

195
00:14:22,875 --> 00:14:24,750
Are you here to ask for punishment,

196
00:14:25,000 --> 00:14:26,291
or to take credit?

197
00:14:26,458 --> 00:14:27,333
Still,

198
00:14:27,666 --> 00:14:30,375
(Shi, Heaven Guardian God)
he played that pawn rather well.

199
00:14:31,458 --> 00:14:33,333
The Qi family was a century-old sect,

200
00:14:33,458 --> 00:14:36,375
deeply rooted and influential
in the Lower City.

201
00:14:37,083 --> 00:14:38,458
If we wanted to bring them down,

202
00:14:39,125 --> 00:14:40,708
we needed a proper excuse.

203
00:14:42,666 --> 00:14:44,708
The Qi Sect failed
in its duty as Defender,

204
00:14:44,708 --> 00:14:46,083
kept monsters in secret,

205
00:14:46,083 --> 00:14:47,500
and brought Haogui into the city.

206
00:14:47,500 --> 00:14:48,958
The entire sect was tainted
by monster aura.

207
00:14:48,958 --> 00:14:49,750
(Yu, Heaven Guardian God)
I have struck the sect from the rolls

208
00:14:49,750 --> 00:14:50,750
(Yu, Heaven Guardian God)
according to law,

209
00:14:50,750 --> 00:14:53,625
and sent the Qi patriarch and all his
disciples to the Undercity

210
00:14:53,625 --> 00:14:54,750
to serve as monster slaves.

211
00:14:54,750 --> 00:14:55,750
All their businesses,

212
00:14:55,958 --> 00:14:57,125
tribute holdings, and private kilns

213
00:14:57,250 --> 00:14:58,208
have been confiscated.

214
00:14:58,583 --> 00:14:59,833
Their total value comes to

215
00:14:59,833 --> 00:15:01,125
898,000 crystals.

216
00:15:02,875 --> 00:15:04,833
From now on, tribute from the Lower City

217
00:15:04,833 --> 00:15:06,958
will lose thirty percent
less to middlemen.

218
00:15:07,416 --> 00:15:09,125
The full amount will
go to Yuyou Village.

219
00:15:09,125 --> 00:15:09,958
Good.

220
00:15:11,083 --> 00:15:12,583
(Yang, Heaven Guardian God)

221
00:15:12,583 --> 00:15:13,833
A fine move.

222
00:15:14,500 --> 00:15:17,333
But word is spreading among the people.

223
00:15:17,833 --> 00:15:20,500
They're saying half-monsters
can be heroes too.

224
00:15:21,208 --> 00:15:23,875
They're saying a kid from Dazedi
fought his way up

225
00:15:24,375 --> 00:15:27,583
and the rules of the Capital
are about to change.

226
00:15:28,541 --> 00:15:29,833
If he keeps climbing,

227
00:15:30,166 --> 00:15:31,541
word will reach the Undercity,

228
00:15:31,541 --> 00:15:32,833
(Te, Heaven Guardian God)
then Dazedi,

229
00:15:32,958 --> 00:15:35,708
then every corner
under Heaven's protection.

230
00:15:36,375 --> 00:15:38,708
Then the balance we've maintained

231
00:15:38,916 --> 00:15:41,166
won't hold much longer.

232
00:15:48,500 --> 00:15:49,458
Next round,

233
00:15:49,708 --> 00:15:50,958
they won't leave alive.

234
00:15:54,708 --> 00:15:56,708
Killing three brats is easy.

235
00:15:57,333 --> 00:16:00,083
But they've already taken root
in people's hearts.

236
00:16:00,500 --> 00:16:01,958
What's the rush?

237
00:16:01,958 --> 00:16:03,958
If everyone insists they're heroes
and good warriors,

238
00:16:04,083 --> 00:16:05,958
then let heroes deal with heroes,

239
00:16:05,958 --> 00:16:07,333
and warriors deal with warriors.

240
00:16:07,958 --> 00:16:09,833
Those three who entered the kiln
in the Jiazi Year

241
00:16:09,875 --> 00:16:12,583
went from celebrated heroes
to watchdogs.

242
00:16:12,833 --> 00:16:13,708
How fitting.

243
00:16:14,333 --> 00:16:15,583
Let them.

244
00:16:20,208 --> 00:16:21,291
Go.

245
00:16:21,291 --> 00:16:22,833
Open the kiln.

246
00:16:23,750 --> 00:16:26,208
I obey the divine decree.

247
00:16:27,583 --> 00:16:29,375
(Yuyou Porcelain Kiln)
(When chaos first parted,)

248
00:16:29,375 --> 00:16:31,583
(Yuyou Porcelain Kiln)
(a god molded mankind from clay.)

249
00:16:31,583 --> 00:16:34,166
(Yet mortals were but bodies
of unfired clay,)

250
00:16:34,166 --> 00:16:36,083
(fragile and short-lived.)

251
00:16:36,083 --> 00:16:38,000
(To transcend mortality
and become undying,)

252
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,125
(they must be tempered in heavenly fire)

253
00:16:40,125 --> 00:16:42,916
(and forged into immortal
porcelain bodies.)

254
00:16:43,625 --> 00:16:46,541
(Now Challengers have brought chaos
to the Capital)

255
00:16:46,541 --> 00:16:48,458
(and endangered its people.)

256
00:16:48,458 --> 00:16:50,833
(Therefore, Generals Zhujian
and Jiao are hereby commanded)

257
00:16:50,833 --> 00:16:52,750
(to assist General Chiming)

258
00:16:52,750 --> 00:16:54,125
(in guarding the Ascension path)

259
00:16:54,125 --> 00:16:56,250
(and crushing all who oppose them.)
